(text "U1 is a 74AHCT125-family buffer; the actual package/module and footprint must match the selected AHCT buffer implementation." (at 18 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8fd989fa-deab-4c13-93d1-ecb684650cc8"))
(text "Gate 1 buffers GPIO8 to ring DIN. Tie /OE low. Unused gates have inputs low, /OE high, and outputs left unconnected." (at 18 29 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7d3df5f6-7f0e-460e-a254-57bfea94c419"))
(text "C1 is local bypassing; its value is TBD. A ring bulk capacitor is also planned; value and installation require build review." (at 18 36 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "696a2b26-f6c4-437e-8505-3e7be0ec1d86"))
(text "Ring power comes from the regulated 5 V rail, with common GND; do not power it from an ESP32 GPIO or 3.3 V pin. See ADR-0006/0008/0011." (at 18 43 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f0170150-edd1-4408-9b67-841dc5affd91"))
